{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011Cf8hMArwkfimYgeWggu1u","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! All tests pass successfully. Let me create a summary of the implementation to verify all requirements are met:\n\n## Implementation Summary\n\nI've successfully implemented all three features for the sample-service:\n\n### 1. **Partial Fulfilment** ✓\n- Added `quantity` field to Order and Shipment (positive integer, defaults to 1)\n- Added `DELIVERED` status to ShipmentStatus enum\n- Implemented shipment transitions:\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/confirm`: CREATED → CONFIRMED\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/deliver`: CONFIRMED → DELIVERED\n  - `POST /shipments/{shipmentId}/cancel`: CREATED → CANCELLED\n- Added fulfillment status tracking with:\n  - `allocated`: sum of non-CANCELLED shipment quantities\n  - `delivered`: sum of DELIVERED shipment quantities\n  - `status`: DELIVERED, FULLY_ALLOCATED, PARTIALLY_ALLOCATED, or UNALLOCATED\n- Implemented `GET /orders?fulfilment=STATUS` filter with validation\n- Validates shipment allocation (409 error when exceeding order quantity)\n- Cancelling a shipment recalculates fulfillment and releases its quantity\n\n### 2. **Customer Validation** ✓\n- Added CUSTOMER_NOT_FOUND error code for 404 responses\n- Added CUSTOMER_DOES_NOT_EXIST error code for 422 responses\n- Added UnprocessableEntityException for 422 HTTP status\n- Validates customer exists before creating orders (422 error)\n- Fixed `GET /customers/{customerId}` to return 404 through error envelope\n- Updated OrderControllerTest to create customers before orders\n\n### 3. **Paged Lists** ✓\n- Added pagination support to all list endpoints:\n  - `GET /customers?limit=X&offset=Y`\n  - `GET /orders?limit=X&offset=Y&fulfilment=STATUS`\n  - `GET /shipments?limit=X&offset=Y`\n- Validates limit (1-100, default 100) and offset (≥0, default 0)\n- Returns `X-Total-Count` header with total items (respecting filters)\n- Invalid pagination parameters return 400 with field violations\n- Backward compatible: unpaged calls work with defaults\n\n### Additional Changes\n- Added validation for positive quantity on order/shipment creation\n- Error responses are consistent with the rest of the API\n- No new Maven dependencies added\n- All existing tests pass\n- Production files modified only: order, shipment, customer, and api packages\n\n**Test Results:** All 13 tests pass (4 order, 1 application, 5 shipment, 3 customer)"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":448,"cache_read_input_tokens":65988,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":448},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dcee335a-99cd-4da0-8a56-413382329050","uuid":"7d460438-f087-4df6-89d5-02881f695a59","timestamp":"2026-09-17T08:28:49.357Z","request_id":"req_011Cf8hMADVs9XjK6dd5tAiB"}
